{
  "file_id": "3603",
  "text_count": 43,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "����Hm? There's a ton of Digimon here,\nfor some reason...",
      "_offset": 909,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Is there some kind of festival\ngoing on?",
      "_offset": 967,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Look, Tai! There's a poster up\nthere.",
      "_offset": 1008,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "What's that? The DigiOne Grand\nPrix?",
      "_offset": 1049,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "You guys should enter, too! Okay,\nentry accepted!",
      "_offset": 1086,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Wait! What's a Gazimon doing here?",
      "_offset": 1136,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "And what's this about the DigiOne\nGrand Prix?",
      "_offset": 1171,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "The DigiOne Grand Prix is an\nannual competition where Digimon\ntest their skills!",
      "_offset": 1217,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "I am Gazimon, the producer of the\nDigiOne Grand Prix.",
      "_offset": 1298,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "I thought all the Gazimon worked\nfor Etemon...",
      "_offset": 1352,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "I'm just an oddball Gazimon, then.",
      "_offset": 1399,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "If you guys don't join, it's your\nloss!",
      "_offset": 1434,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "There's an amazing prize for\nwinning, you see!",
      "_offset": 1474,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Huh... it sounds kind of\ninteresting.",
      "_offset": 1521,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "It'd be nice to do something like\nthis for a change.",
      "_offset": 1559,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Contestants should speak to me\nwhen they're ready. I'll explain\nthe rules before the game starts.",
      "_offset": 1612,
      "_length": 97,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Okay, we'll come back.",
      "_offset": 1710,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "All right, I'll explain the rules.",
      "_offset": 1733,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "There will be three battles, with\nno breaks in between...",
      "_offset": 1768,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "You'll get a fabulous prize if you\nemerge victorious. Those are the\nrules. Happy fighting!",
      "_offset": 1826,
      "_length": 90,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "And so ends the battle! A\nbreakthrough in the first round!\nCongratulations!",
      "_offset": 1917,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Not bad, right?",
      "_offset": 1993,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Not bad.",
      "_offset": 2009,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Oh, don't get comfortable yet.\nYour second round opponent is...\nthis team!",
      "_offset": 2018,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "And so ends the battle! A\nbreakthrough in the second round,\nright on track!",
      "_offset": 2093,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "We'll keep going as far as we can!",
      "_offset": 2169,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "That's the spirit! At last, it's\ntime for the finals!",
      "_offset": 2204,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "But the enemies you've faced up\nuntil now are nothing compared to\nthese!",
      "_offset": 2258,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Think you can take 'em down?",
      "_offset": 2331,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "And so ends the battle!",
      "_offset": 2360,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "This year's DigiOne Grand Prix\nwinners are...",
      "_offset": 2384,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "...the Agumon team!\nCongratulations, congratulations!",
      "_offset": 2430,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Wow! I didn't know we were *this*\nstrong.",
      "_offset": 2484,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "We're expert fighters!",
      "_offset": 2526,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "So then, here's the prize, as\npromised!",
      "_offset": 2549,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Hooray!",
      "_offset": 2589,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "We did it, Tai! We did it,\nguys!",
      "_offset": 2597,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Thanks for helping us out, Mimi!\nThanks, guys!",
      "_offset": 2633,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Please come back as a contestant\nnext year!",
      "_offset": 2680,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Ah, that was fun. We should come\nback again sometime, Tai.",
      "_offset": 2724,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Yeah! We'll be a lot stronger when\nwe do.",
      "_offset": 2786,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "I've been burning up and training\nthis whole past year. I, Meramon,\nwill be the winner for sure!!",
      "_offset": 2828,
      "_length": 97,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "I, Meramon, will be the winner for\nsure!!",
      "_offset": 2926,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}